  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/arango-solutions/aws-ontology#verificationMethod">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>An independent, mechanical check the ontology's content was validated against after authoring (e.g. owl-dl-reasoning, shacl-validation, automated-test-suite), offered as the analogue of document-grounded faithfulness for content that has no source documents to cite.</rdfs:comment>
